msgid "Everyone scores the sprint 1–5. Restate the goal: improve, no blame."
msgstr "Everyone scores the sprint 1–5. Restate the goal: improve, no blame."

msgid "2. Review previous actions"
msgstr "2. Review previous actions"

msgid "Walk through the previous retro's actions: what was done, what stalled and why."
msgstr "Walk through the previous retro's actions: what was done, what stalled and why."

msgid "3. Collect data"
msgstr "3. Collect data"

msgid "Everyone writes input in silence first (Start/Stop/Continue or Mad/Sad/Glad) before anyone speaks."
msgstr "Everyone writes input in silence first (Start/Stop/Continue or Mad/Sad/Glad) before anyone speaks."

msgid "4. Cluster & vote"
msgstr "4. Cluster & vote"

msgid "Group similar input and dot-vote the two or three themes that matter most."
msgstr "Group similar input and dot-vote the two or three themes that matter most."

msgid "5. Deep dive"
msgstr "5. Deep dive"

msgid "Discuss the chosen themes; hunt causes, not symptoms (ask why five times)."
msgstr "Discuss the chosen themes; hunt causes, not symptoms (ask why five times)."

msgid "6. Decide actions"
msgstr "6. Decide actions"

msgid "Define at most two or three actions with an owner and a due date — more usually means none get done."
msgstr "Define at most two or three actions with an owner and a due date — more usually means none get done."

msgid "7. Wrap up"
msgstr "7. Wrap up"

msgid "Short retro on the retro: was this useful, what do we change next time?"
msgstr "Short retro on the retro: was this useful, what do we change next time?"

msgid "1. Opening & sprint goal"
msgstr "1. Opening & sprint goal"

msgid "Restate the sprint goal and planned scope. Was the goal met — yes or no, and why in one sentence."
msgstr "Restate the sprint goal and planned scope. Was the goal met — yes or no, and why in one sentence."

msgid "2. Results overview"
msgstr "2. Results overview"

msgid "The numbers: planned vs done per the Definition of Done, plus carry-over. Name what is not done — no discussion yet."
msgstr "The numbers: planned vs done per the Definition of Done, plus carry-over. Name what is not done — no discussion yet."

msgid "3. Demo of the increment"
msgstr "3. Demo of the increment"

msgid "Each member briefly demos their own finished items — working functionality, no slides, done items only. Agree the order upfront so it tells one story."
msgstr "Each member briefly demos their own finished items — working functionality, no slides, done items only. Agree the order upfront so it tells one story."

msgid "4. Unfinished items"
msgstr "4. Unfinished items"

msgid "Per carry-over item: status, what blocked it, and whether it moves to the next sprint or back to the backlog."
msgstr "Per carry-over item: status, what blocked it, and whether it moves to the next sprint or back to the backlog."

msgid "5. Backlog & outlook"
msgstr "5. Backlog & outlook"

msgid "Look at the top of the backlog together: are priorities still right given what this sprint taught you? Capture new insights as items right away."
msgstr "Look at the top of the backlog together: are priorities still right given what this sprint taught you? Capture new insights as items right away."

msgid "6. Wrap up"
msgstr "6. Wrap up"

msgid "Summarise the key outcomes and confirm backlog changes. Then on to the retrospective."
msgstr "Summarise the key outcomes and confirm backlog changes. Then on to the retrospective."

